@base = http://127.0.0.1:5080
@policy = http-demo-policy
@client = CLI-HTTP
@instance = chain-http-001
@approval = {{instance}}-s1-r1

### Environment (use port 5081 for the Azure-connected console)
GET {{base}}/api/environment

### Business steps an override may target (hard-coded from the analysis; unknown codes get 400)
GET {{base}}/api/business-steps

### Simulator actors: replace this exact client/account scope without creating a policy version.
POST {{base}}/api/demo-identities
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "{{client}}",
  "accountId": null,
  "assignments": {"Finance": "finance", "Client": "client"}
}

### Simulator assignments (separate from approval policies)
GET {{base}}/api/demo-identities

### Save a roles-only policy set: a default chain for every business step plus per-step overrides.
### Stages, role order, and timeouts only; never actor assignments. Save creates one new version of the whole set.
POST {{base}}/api/policies
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{policy}}",
  "clientId": "{{client}}",
  "baseVersion": 0,
  "defaultStages": [{"name": "review", "roles": ["Finance"], "timeoutMinutes": 15}],
  "overrides": [
    {"workflowCode": "B07", "stages": [
      {"name": "review", "roles": ["Finance"], "timeoutMinutes": 15},
      {"name": "client", "roles": ["Client"], "timeoutMinutes": 15}]}
  ]
}

### Saved policies and active selections
GET {{base}}/api/policies

### Which chain would a workflow use? B07 has an override; any other step uses the default.
GET {{base}}/api/policy-match?clientId={{client}}&workflowCode=B07

###
GET {{base}}/api/policy-match?clientId={{client}}&workflowCode=B08

### Unchanged save: 200, same version. Only content changes create a new active version.
POST {{base}}/api/policies
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{policy}}",
  "clientId": "{{client}}",
  "baseVersion": 1,
  "defaultStages": [{"name": "review", "roles": ["Finance"], "timeoutMinutes": 15}],
  "overrides": [
    {"workflowCode": "B07", "stages": [
      {"name": "review", "roles": ["Finance"], "timeoutMinutes": 15},
      {"name": "client", "roles": ["Client"], "timeoutMinutes": 15}]}
  ]
}

### Start: this is the only business start endpoint. Use a fresh instance ID.
POST {{base}}/api/workflows
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instanceId": "{{instance}}",
  "clientId": "{{client}}",
  "workflowCode": "B07",
  "planId": "sunny-soda",
  "version": 3,
  "requester": "requester",
  "correlationId": "crm-ticket-4711"
}

### Parent workflow status and pinned policy
GET {{base}}/api/workflows/{{instance}}

### Workflow choices for the full-plan overview
GET {{base}}/api/workflows

### All pinned steps: 1.1/1.2 parallel, 2.1 blocked until stage 1 finishes
GET {{base}}/api/workflows/{{instance}}/approvals

### Stale decision: sent, refused by the step, still waiting
POST {{base}}/api/approvals/{{approval}}/decision
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{"actingAs":"finance","outcome":"Approve","version":2}

### Approve the waiting child (demo actor, not Entra authentication)
POST {{base}}/api/approvals/{{approval}}/decision
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{"actingAs":"finance","outcome":"Approve","version":3}

### Child status/history; final receipt is on the parent workflow
GET {{base}}/api/approvals/{{approval}}?history=true

### Reject (use a different waiting run). Reject and Return need a comment; without one the API answers 400.
POST {{base}}/api/approvals/{{approval}}/decision
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{"actingAs":"finance","outcome":"Reject","version":3,"comment":"Budget is wrong"}

### Return for changes (use a different waiting run). The plan goes back to the requester and the chain ends.
POST {{base}}/api/approvals/{{approval}}/decision
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{"actingAs":"finance","outcome":"Return","version":3,"comment":"Add the budget breakdown"}

### Not found: 404
GET {{base}}/api/workflows/chain-does-not-exist
